{"availability":"available","full":"keix40/receipt-split","name":"receipt-split","description":"Snap a restaurant receipt, tap what you had, and split tax & tip fairly. AI OCR, cent-exact math, and group balances with debt simplification.","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-29T11:27:58Z","updated":"2026-10-06T06:52:21Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://receipt-split-gamma-sable.vercel.app","topics":["ai-sdk","bill-splitting","drizzle-orm","expense-tracker","nextjs","ocr","playwright","postgresql","react","shadcn-ui","tailwindcss","typescript","vercel","vitest","zod"],"demo":"https://receipt-split-gamma-sable.vercel.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T15:45:57.264Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-06T15:45:57.264Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-06T15:45:57.264Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T15:45:57.264Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React","Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Snap the receipt. Tap what you had. Split tax and tip fairly, down to the cent.","Receipt Split turns a photo of a restaurant receipt into structured line items, lets everyone at the table claim what they ordered, and computes a fair split with tax and tip shared in proportion to what each person actually ate. Groups keep a running history and a simplified \"who owes whom\" list, so settling up takes the fewest possible payments.","Live demo: receipt-split-gamma-sable.vercel.app"],"features":["📷 Receipt OCR with structured output. A vision LLM (through the Vercel AI SDK) returns line items, quantities, tax, tip, service charges and totals, validated against a zod schema. If the model call fails, it falls…","🔍 Numbers are checked, not trusted. Line items are compared with the subtotal, and subtotal + tax + tip + fees with the total. Anything that doesn't add up is shown to you to fix; nothing gets \"corrected\" behind your…","👆 Tap to claim. Everyone taps the items they had. Shared dishes split evenly, or by portions (e.g. 2 of 3 dumplings).","⚖️ Fair, exact split. Tax, tip and fees are divided in proportion to each person's subtotal. Largest-remainder rounding means the shares always add up to the receipt total, with no lost or extra cents.","👥 Groups & running balances. Finalized receipts and repayments feed a ledger. Guests can join without an account."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/keix40/receipt-split/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"6e56479c9b203d037700460dac876f6cb125caeeb729fe452510613d06bc62c4","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T15:45:57.412Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T15:45:57.412Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Snap the receipt. Tap what you had. Split tax and tip fairly, down to the cent.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/keix40/receipt-split/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"not_required","text":"Guests can join without an account.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/keix40/receipt-split/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"api_key","status":"not_required","text":"Deployments authenticate with OIDC, so no API key is needed there.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/keix40/receipt-split/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"6e56479c9b203d037700460dac876f6cb125caeeb729fe452510613d06bc62c4","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/keix40/receipt-split/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T15:45:57.412Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-06T06:52:21Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/keix40/receipt-split/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T15:45:57.413Z","hash":"6e56479c9b203d037700460dac876f6cb125caeeb729fe452510613d06bc62c4","originalBytes":10575,"storedBytes":10575,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["npm","ocr","run","vercel","blob","split","postgres","receipt","typescript","api","each","test","database","e2e","items","tests","auth","store","tax","tip","url","better","gateway","model","next.js","playwright","sha